@title How Webhook Retries Work
@subtitle What happens when your endpoint does not answer with a 2xx

When an event such as order.paid fires, we deliver it to your endpoint with a POST. If that attempt fails, we keep trying on a growing schedule for about 36 hours before giving up.

diagram retry dir=TB title="Webhook delivery and retry path"
